{"id":"la_stima","lemma":"lástima","pos":"noun","rank":1193,"glosses":["pity"],"ipa":"/ˈlastima/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lástimas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-l%C3%A1stima.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso es una lástima.","en":"That's too bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441139"},{"text":"Eso es una verdadera lástima.","en":"That's a real shame.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522459"},{"text":"Ella tuvo lástima por él.","en":"She took pity on him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453767"},{"text":"Nunca confundas lástima con amor.","en":"Never confuse pity with love.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333676"},{"text":"Es una lástima que se divorcien.","en":"It's a pity they're getting divorced.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568229"}]}